  "label": "Meme Textual Formatting and Irony",
  "description": "The meme uses a specific textual format (top text, bottom text) and ironic juxtaposition to create humor. The bottom text 'ooOOOh, who's my big boy' is a common phrase used in domestic or infantilizing contexts, which requires knowledge of meme conventions and cultural irony to understand the satirical intent.",
